  "2026-10-17T13:58:17.605Z","harness:codex","The shared helper indexes retained warnings and all deciding causes once, then filters findings in original order. A220warning/101failure fixture preserves blockers outside both samples, duplicate findings, verdicts, and input immutability across standard/brief/summary/full. Two older test-only inputs omitted the required failed_because array; update those fixtures to declare no blockers instead of adding a production fallback solely for tests. Their existing receipt and redaction assertions remain intact."
  "2026-10-17T14:00:50.891Z","harness:codex","Verification:75focused health/CLI/SDK tests and complete typecheck pass. The final canonical severity fixture also passes its4unit cases. Focused ESLint passes and the public SDK snapshot reports zero changes. Shared Set membership removes all three repeated array-scan predicates and the per-finding warning slice, while retaining original finding order, duplicate rows and complete blocking causes across all four projections."
